{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-team-contact-tempalte-js","path":"/team/loai-al-fakir/contact/","result":{"data":{"strapiTeam":{"services":null,"locations":"Dubai","strapi_id":2,"id":"d8b94034-0d5b-5b57-9965-58871440f7bf","rank":1,"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Loai_ff4b84043b_5a79eba0ae.jpg"},"slug":"loai-al-fakir","publish":true,"phone":"+971 4 892 5831","office_phone":"+971 4 892 5831","name":"Loai Al Fakir","experience_since":"2008","license":null,"email":"info@providentestate.com","designation":"CEO & Founder","extra":null,"about":{"data":{"about":"<p>Recognized as one of Dubai’s most visionary real estate leaders, Loai Al Fakir founded Provident Estate in 2008 with a mission to set new benchmarks of excellence, integrity, and innovation. Named among the Top 150 Real Estate Icons of the UAE by the Finance World Powerlist, his leadership continues to inspire and shape the future of the industry.</p><p>His long-standing partnerships with leading developers, along with the trust placed in him by clients and peers, reinforce his reputation as one of the most respected voices in Dubai’s property market.</p><p>Under his leadership, Provident has achieved record-breaking milestones, from securing exclusive sales rights for landmark developments to closing some of the city’s most high-profile transactions. His foresight and commitment to innovation have positioned Provident Estate at the forefront of Dubai’s real estate landscape.</p><p>Beyond transactions, Loai has transformed Provident into a fully integrated real estate powerhouse. Today, the firm offers a complete suite of services, including sales, leasing, asset and tenant management, tailored mortgage solutions, holiday rentals, and conveyancing support, ensuring seamless guidance at every stage of the client journey.</p><p>For Loai, real estate is ultimately about people. As he often reflects:</p><p>“Real estate is never just about property; it is about people and the trust they place in us to guide them. When we honour that trust, success follows naturally.”</p>"}},"sale_summary":{"total_count":"62","primary_total_count":"62","total_monetary_value":221828115.76,"secondary_total_count":0,"primary_total_monetary_value":221828115.76,"secondary_total_monetary_value":0,"last_update":"08-05-26","developers":[{"name":"Sobha Realty","total_count":"15"},{"name":"DAMAC Properties","total_count":"8"},{"name":"Sobha","total_count":"18"},{"name":"Emaar Properties","total_count":"6"},{"name":"Aldar","total_count":"2"},{"name":"Imtiaz Developments","total_count":"3"},{"name":"emaar","total_count":"2"},{"name":"Al Habtoor","total_count":"1"},{"name":"Reportage","total_count":"1"},{"name":"Azizi","total_count":"3"},{"name":"Majid Al Futtaim","total_count":"1"},{"name":"Damac","total_count":"1"},{"name":"EMPIRES HEIGHTS PROPERTIES","total_count":"1"}]},"category":{"strapi_json_value":["Management"],"id":"904a1868-1aaf-5d44-8f1c-bebec831c7f1"},"languages":{"strapi_json_value":["English","Arabic"],"id":"2e32e917-9ea0-55e1-b11d-70c831468d1a"},"reviews":[],"bio":null,"achievements":null,"countries":null,"clients":null,"years":null,"negotiator_mapping":null,"negotiator_id":"6819","show_transaction":true,"imagetransforms":null,"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/Loai_ff4b84043b_5a79eba0ae.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/350x450/Loai_ff4b84043b_5a79eba0ae.webp","transform":"350x450","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/160x220/Loai_ff4b84043b_5a79eba0ae.webp","transform":"160x220","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/550x775/Loai_ff4b84043b_5a79eba0ae.webp","transform":"550x775","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x450/Loai_ff4b84043b_5a79eba0ae.webp","transform":"376x450","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.